{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ECHO-fd52-1a86-4159","published":"2026-06-22T13:45:03.084Z","modified":"2026-08-31T15:15:02.938993163Z","withdrawn":"2026-08-31T14:30:19.360Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-7598","GHSA-r56h-j38w-hrqq"],"summary":"Race in Kubernetes namespace termination (k/k#126587), scoped upstream to\n\"kube-apiserver >= v1.3\" — control-plane behaviour, not library code a\nclient can reach. We ship only the image-updater client; k8s.io/kubernetes\nis transitive, and the binary carries no pkg/registry, pkg/controller or\npkg/kubeapiserver symbols on either arch (`go tool nm`). Fixed cluster-side\nby KEP-5080 (stable 1.34); GO-2025-3547 lists no fix, so no bump clears it.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"argocd-image-updater","ecosystem":"Echo","purl":"pkg:deb/echo/argocd-image-updater"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.0+e1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisory.echohq.com/osv/ECHO-fd52-1a86-4159.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kubernetes-1.28","ecosystem":"Echo","purl":"pkg:deb/echo/kubernetes-1.28"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.28.15+e8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisory.echohq.com/osv/ECHO-fd52-1a86-4159.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kubernetes-1.29","ecosystem":"Echo","purl":"pkg:deb/echo/kubernetes-1.29"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.29.15+e26"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisory.echohq.com/osv/ECHO-fd52-1a86-4159.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kubernetes-1.29-fips","ecosystem":"Echo","purl":"pkg:deb/echo/kubernetes-1.29-fips"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.29.15+e18"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisory.echohq.com/osv/ECHO-fd52-1a86-4159.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kubernetes-1.30","ecosystem":"Echo","purl":"pkg:deb/echo/kubernetes-1.30"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.30.14+e18"}]}],"database_s